the ending.\n\n{1292510498519654}\n\nFinally\nThis title includes an auto-save system that records your progress automatically.  \n However, please note that there is no option to reset your data.\n\nJust like your real-life youth was a once-in-a-lifetime experience, the youth you live through in this game is also unique and fleeting.   \nCherish each moment and enjoy the present to the fullest.\n", "short_description": "\"SchoolFriendMemories Vol.2\" is a romance adventure game where you can experience the youthful days of high school, centering around everyday conversations with Akari Akesaka, a senior aiming for art school.\n\nAs the protagonist, you will relive the process of gradually deepening your bond with the heroine through daily interactions.\n\nEnjoy a moment of youth in a VR space that brings the school atmosphere to life."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "sozai1.png", "id": "2356403878065960", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392301_2356403881399293_5160666627903576270_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I8QVpTqcEf0Q7kNvwEkrUzo&_nc_oc=AdoSs99ZIHSG4AzGooZScEpl-ysq6agHsYJnYhhETqusnm8gKzAY0tfhGlKZM5kD0XY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSn5huczaHk-JCGjoX9jfn5wz-S_-2e1g2NMCTx9WzZAw&oe=6B06FCF0"}, {"file_name": "sozai5.png", "id": "1862155974567007", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392127_1862155981233673_6629870527784498539_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6Vl_03_SVz8Q7kNvwFd7cBW&_nc_oc=AdrCHnittYBoBy6zuioJdFbJVX4XaQ2ZC5BroC4n_caRVo_3tGjbuKhk4MTXpY0GaZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTq4WP6_ywTSqJn8kgYc_F-60IjJjoNDPh4ynQXzYEoeQ&oe=6B0717E7"}, {"file_name": "sozai2.png", "id": "1198978045112343", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-i